WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.350
The 1950s.

00:00:02.300 --> 00:00:05.025
Cold War and Broken Promises.

00:00:05.025 --> 00:00:10.175
Canada enters the Korean War, losing 516 soldiers.

00:00:10.175 --> 00:00:12.512
NORAD is established.

00:00:12.512 --> 00:00:22.575
The Avro Arrow, Canada's most advanced fighter jet, is built then destroyed along with 14,000 jobs — permanently crippling Canadian aerospace.
